msgctxt "'folders' means email-folders, not folders on disc."
msgid "Counting folders..."
msgstr "फोल्डर मन ल गिनत हे..."

#: filter_plain.cxx:25
msgid "Import Plain Text Emails"
msgstr "सादा पाठ ई-मेल आयात करव"

#: filter_plain.cxx:27
msgid ""
